1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:09,800
We arrive at Slide 39: "Reclaiming Offline Focus." Why did we spend all this energy engineering agents?

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:18,350
We didn't do it just to stare at screens for more hours! The true fruit of agentic mastery is reclaiming your human life.

3
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:31,770
Look at Card 1: The Digital Sabbath. Because your avatars are actively filtering spam and monitoring servers, you can unplug your phone on the weekend with complete peace of mind.

4
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:42,620
Look at Card 2: Deep Intellectual Work. You have hours of unbroken silence to read profound books, write strategic plans, and create lasting art.

5
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:52,750
And Card 3: Family and Community. You can look into the eyes of your loved ones without checking your inbox every two minutes.

6
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:59,160
Soli Deo Gloria: using technology to become more fully human, not a machine.

